  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2e811ff2e3d71e44497d87cf957c8c63, type: 3}
  m_Name: InstructionsConfig_Short
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Holobiont.InstructionsConfig
  controlsText: "<b>W / S</b> \u2014 Faster / slower breath.\n\r\n<b>D / A</b> \u2014
    Deeper / shallower breath (sizes the field).\n\r\n<b>Space</b> \u2014 Hold breath.
    Mid-exhale bonds creatures in the field; mid-inhale releases the most-stressed.\n\r\n<b>Esc</b>
    \u2014 Pause.\r\n\r\nOff-baseline or held too long drains stamina; empty = forced
    recovery."
  howToPlayText: "You are a holobiont \u2014 a colony bound by breath. Survive as
    long as you can.\r\n\r\nYour field breathes on its own: exhales pull free creatures
    in, inhales push them out. Use WASD to shape the rhythm and Space to hold a breath
    \u2014 mid-exhale to bond, mid-inhale to release.\r\n\r\n\u2022 <b>Nutrici</b>
    feed you energy.\n\u2022 <b>Scudo</b> shield you from environment shifts.\n\u2022
    <b>Hub</b> raises capacity and slots.\r\n\r\nEnergy drains from upkeep, stress,
    and resistance mismatch. Hit zero and the colony cascades."
